---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Cookie Policy"
  description="How this website uses cookies and similar technologies."
>
  <section class="section legal">
    <div class="container legal__inner prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
      <h2>What are cookies?</h2>
      <p>
        Cookies are small text files placed on your device when you visit a website. They're widely used to make
        websites work, or work more efficiently, as well as to provide information to the site owner.
      </p>

      <h2>How this site uses cookies</h2>
      <p>
        This website is built to be as lightweight as possible. The "Get in touch" and newsletter sign-up forms
        send your message directly to Formspree, our form processing service, without setting any cookies on
        this site.
      </p>
      <p>
        If enabled, this site uses Google Analytics to understand which pages are useful and roughly where
        visitors come from (for example, search, social media, or a direct link). Google Analytics sets cookies
        to do this, but only after you've given consent via the cookie banner — it never runs before you choose,
        and never runs at all if you select "Reject". Google Analytics reports aggregate, anonymised statistics
        (such as country-level location and traffic source); it does not give us access to your name or IP
        address. See{' '}
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Google's Privacy Policy
        </a>{' '}
        for how Google handles this data.
      </p>

      <h2>Essential cookies</h2>
      <p>
        A strictly necessary cookie-free storage entry is used to remember your cookie consent choice. This
        doesn't require consent under UK cookie rules.
      </p>

      <h2>Managing cookies</h2>
      <p>
        Most web browsers let you control cookies through their settings. Blocking some cookies may affect how
        parts of this website work. You can also change your analytics consent choice for this site at any time
        below.
      </p>
      <p>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-dark" id="manage-cookie-preferences">
          Manage cookie preferences
        </button>
      </p>

      <p class="text-muted">
        Questions about this policy? Contact <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal__inner {
    max-width: 42rem;
  }
</style>

<script>
  document.getElementById('manage-cookie-preferences')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    localStorage.removeItem('cookie-consent');
    window.location.reload();
  });
</script>
